      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14877/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place shredded zucchini in a bowl and toss with 1/2 teaspoon salt; let stand for 15 minutes. Transfer into a clean kitchen towel and wring out excess liquid into the sink.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C7E1wJ-xcufcQ-MVlURDBh7lDVM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14877-zucchini-pie-ddmfs-step3-3x4-2193-1fad1d118d274a5b8aba3ac285410071.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14877/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9-inch pie plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YbxQx3MtFIa0ci1xunQFmu6k-38=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14877-zucchini-pie-ddmfs-step2-3x4-2188-043d23daee054f7f9bdcc09d7fbdbcfe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14877/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine zucchini, eggs, baking mix, onion, melted butter, Cheddar cheese, Parmesan cheese, rosemary, parsley, and pepper in a large bowl; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iH6JIaU5vOTTxCrJ6GGvLjoIKBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14877-zucchini-pie-ddmfs-step4-3x4-2199-1cee7fe9d5ff44659c5c81259f667e04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14877/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread mixture into the prepared pie plate or baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zP5LW2lHgS_kQ6YEsnt1UYVCQ2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14877-zucchini-pie-ddmfs-step5-3x4-2201-5783adcb9ee743259aafa0a6ad12c83e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14877/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and a knife inserted in the center comes out clean, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
